OL,3,GNEWSAStormont needs 'fair funding
OL,4,Apackage', deputy first minster says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deputy first minister says a
OL,7,F"balanced and reasonable" budget cannot
OL,8,Fbe reached in Northern Ireland unless
OL,9,Fthe government gives Stormont more
OL,10,Fmoney.
OL,12,FEmma Little-Pengelly said the executive
OL,13,Fmet with the secretary of state on
OL,14,FFriday to "put across the best possible
OL,15,Fcase for fair funding".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
