OL,3,GNEWSAStormont needs 'fair funding
OL,4,Apackage', deputy first minster says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe executive has not agreed a budget
OL,7,Ffor this year, blaming the UK's
OL,8,Fdevolution funding formula for leaving
OL,9,Fit short. Additional funding of about
OL,10,F#1.5bn would be released in three
OL,11,Ftranches, with #525m available this
OL,12,Fyear.
OL,14,FSecretary of State Sir Chris Bryant,
OL,15,Fwho has said there was "no more money"
OL,16,Favailable, earlier this week accused
OL,17,Fexecutive ministers of being
OL,18,Ffinancially "irresponsible".
